{"ID":"20240314092236-a7rgu76","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092236-a7rgu76","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092236-a7rgu76\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160840-0whvjc4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160840-0tny4pq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160840-0tny4pq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:45,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:45\u0026#125;","title":"【射干麻黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160840-0whvjc4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-0whvjc4","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳而上气，喉中水鸡声，射干麻黄汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-kmzjlcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-kmzjlcm","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"射干麻黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-0x6w3gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-0x6w3gl","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"射干三两\t麻黄四两\t生姜四两\t细辛三两\t紫菀三两\t款冬花三两\t五味子半斤\t大枣七枚\t半夏半升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-24adkwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-24adkwk","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右九味，以水一斗二升，先煮麻黄两沸，去上沫，内诸药，煮取三升，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-0x5bfkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-0x5bfkd","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，接下来看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"咳而上气，喉中水鸡声，射干麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-lutx4oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-lutx4oq","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果不是乡下出生的话，你说这个水鸡声，对不对，什么叫水鸡声你就搞不清楚，形容嘛，可能当初张仲景家就住在池塘旁边，那个水鸡就在叫，就是这个声音，把它写下来，那水鸡声，这个你不用去担心他，最重要你要知道什么时候是使用射干麻黄汤，射干麻黄汤是专门设计起来，这个很好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-mrxau6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-mrxau6x","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒饮咳嗽用射干麻黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，专门是寒饮，也就是说，如果你是看到热那根本不可能是射干麻黄汤，一定是寒饮。那寒饮的咳嗽呢，肺是持续的扩张的状态之下，比如吸气他吐气都吐不出来，肺就张在那边，没办法吐气，肺处于持续的扩张的状态之下。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-smcxbjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-smcxbjc","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"射干麻黄汤呢，它的来源呢就是从小青龙汤来的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小青龙汤呢，把白芍，炙甘草拿掉以后，加上紫菀，款冬花、射干，这就是我们现在所讲的射干麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-pjs1gfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-pjs1gfl","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个射干麻黄汤呢？你看这个剂量，射干、麻黄、细辛、紫菀、款冬花，那使用上面用得很多，诸位在看咳嗽痰饮的时候，我们常常会问病人，你咳嗽气喘，请问你是吸气困难，还是吐气困难，病人说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"哎是吸入困难，吸入呢为肾，吐气困难呢，吐出呢为肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果肾气很正常，肾气很强，你吸气的时候，从鼻子吸气一路就会到肾脏去，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为肾脏可以纳气，因为肾可以纳气，所以肾为肺之子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肺气会下降，直接会降到肾脏里面来，当你肾脏有问题的时候，你吸气就吸到肺里就出去了，就没有办法吸得很深，同样的，吐气的时候是肺。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-csseg35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-csseg35","updated":"20240422160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果这个病人呢，上气，咳而上气，他是吐气非常不好吐，我们就知道是肺的问题，那射干麻黄汤呢因为是寒饮，所以病人一定没有口渴，对不对，舌苔是白的，那一般来说，只要有咳嗽，我不管你是虚热还是寒饮，大部分晚上三点到五点都会醒过来不能睡觉，就是因为这个肺里面有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160840-0tny4pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160840-0tny4pq","updated":"20240422160842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个处方呢，我曾经用这个处方治疗十几年的咳嗽、气喘一下就好了，所以你只要用对，非常好用。"}]}]}